## Third-party code

This project contains code that is not ours. The terms below are in addition to, not
instead of, the choice above — retaining these notices is a condition of using that code.

### llama.cpp

Tiles UI began as a copy of the llama-server web interface (`tools/ui`) from
[ggml-org/llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), which is MIT licensed:

> Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors

The full text is in [LICENSE-llama.cpp](LICENSE-llama.cpp) and must be retained in
distributions of this software. MIT permits sublicensing, which is what allows the combined
work to be offered under the dual license above; it does not remove the MIT terms from the
original code.

### Geist and Geist Mono

The fonts vendored via `@fontsource-variable/geist` and `@fontsource-variable/geist-mono`
are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:

> Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)

The full text is in [LICENSE-GEIST](LICENSE-GEIST). Note the OFL's Reserved Font Name
clause: a modified version of these fonts may not be distributed under the name "Geist".

### Vendored libraries

